{%- comment -%}
CZ Recommended Products Block — Browse (A/B variant)
Reads last_viewed_product_id. Calls Shopify recs API. Renders available products.
Deduplicates by Shopify product.id. Excludes recently browsed products from recs.

Display rules:
- Fewer than 3 available → section hidden
- 3–5 available → 1 row of 3 cards
- 6 available → 2 rows of 3 cards

Layout: outer table width:100% (responsive); inner card table width:100%; each card td width:33%.
Images square-cropped at source (&height=380&crop=center); height:auto keeps them square at any width.
Two-pass approach: Pass 1 counts (excluding pre-seeded browse IDs). Pass 2 renders rows directly.
seen_browse pre-seeds both Pass 1 and Pass 2 so browsed products are excluded throughout.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign seen_browse = "," -%}
{%- assign browsed_all = custom_attribute.${recently_browsed_products} | default: empty -%}
{%- if browsed_all != empty and browsed_all != blank -%}
{%- assign browsed_products = browsed_all | reverse | slice: 0, 8 -%}
{%- for bp in browsed_products -%}
{%- assign bp_id = bp.product_id | default: "" | plus: 0 | append: "" -%}
{%- if bp_id != "" and bp_id != "0" -%}
{%- assign bp_check = "," | append: bp_id | append: "," -%}
{%- unless seen_browse contains bp_check -%}
{%- assign seen_browse = seen_browse | append: bp_id | append: "," -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign anchor_id = {{custom_attribute.${last_viewed_product_id}}} -%}
{%- if anchor_id != blank -%}
{%- connected_content https://www.the-citizenry.com/recommendations/products.json?product_id={{ anchor_id }}&limit=10
    :save recs
    :cache_max_age 1800
-%}
{%- assign shown = 0 -%}
{%- assign seen_ids = seen_browse -%}
{%- for product in recs.products -%}
{%- if shown >= 6 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign id_check = "," | append: product.id | append: "," -%}
{%- unless seen_ids contains id_check -%}
{%- if product.available == true -%}
{%- assign seen_ids = seen_ids | append: product.id | append: "," -%}
{%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if shown >= 3 -%}
